  "message_id": "MSG_0062",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0E 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 7F 0A}那么，请陪我一会儿吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e803_210.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞从美鹤的眼神中可以看出她很认真……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e803_210.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0E 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}虽然很突然，但这项委托{F2 01 03 01}有期限{F2 01 01 01}。\n毕竟机不可失。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e803_210.bf.json:10:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 7E 0A}那我等着你。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
